Hi Julie,
I think what must be happening is that some units don’t have 2 matches within the caliper.

I think you can get 2 matches per person by setting calclosest=TRUE, which will take the closest available match if there aren’t any left within the caliper:

http://r.iq.harvard.edu/docs/matchit/2.4-20/Additional_Arguments_f3.html

Thanks,
Liz


